# Root-level environment for `docker compose`. Nothing here yet.
#
# Each service that reads a .env file has its own example next to it:
#   services/agent-service/.env.example    LLM_API_KEY (required), LLM model settings
#   services/copilot-runtime/.env.example  PORT, AGENT_URL (optional)
# Copy one to .env in the same folder. .env files are git-ignored; never commit them.
# In deployed environments these values come from the company secret manager.
#
# Verifier SDK (docs/verifier.md), not used yet:
# VERIFIER_API_KEY=
